OL,3,AReform activist suspended after
OL,4,Areportedly saying Muslims cannot be
OL,5,ABritish
OL,6,
OL,7,FReform UK has suspended a party
OL,8,Factivist who reportedly said that you
OL,9,Fcannot be Muslim and British in footage
OL,10,Frecorded by an undercover reporter from
OL,11,FITV News.
OL,13,FIt is also investigating two of its
OL,14,Fcouncillors who appear to have
OL,15,Fadvocated for the mass shooting of
OL,16,Fgrooming gang members in the footage.
OL,18,FThe party's response follows the latest
OL,19,Fallegations from undercover filming by
OL,20,FITV News, which has led to Reform
OL,21,Ffacing questions over its vetting
OL,22,Fprocedures for candidates.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
